  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "If A is an m x n matrix then A (Transpose of A) is an n x m matrix, such that rows of A become\ncolumns of A and columns of A become rows of A .\nGiven a 2D array, you have to implement the given function,\nint** Transpose(int** matrix, int rowCount, int columnCount);\nint** Transpose(int** matrix, int rowCount, int columnCount);\nstatic int[][] Transpose(int[][] matrix);\nstatic int[,] Transpose(int[,] matrix);\ndef Transpose(matrix):\nImplement the function to find the transpose of the matrix and return the new matrix as output.",
    "constraints": [
      "None"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "matrix:\n2 4\n6 8",
    "outputFormat": "2 6\n4 8",
    "notes": [],
